          "email": "timday@thelustrecollective.com",
          "date": "2026-11-23 16:31:36.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-18687 build: include module.h by its kernel path",
        "message": "LU-18687 build: include module.h by its kernel path\n\nThe in-kernel build of Lustre fails with:\n\n  fs/lustre/include/obd_class.h:20:10: fatal error:\n  'lustre_compat/linux/module.h' file not found\n\ncopy-builtin leaves include/lustre_compat behind.  The headers there\nshadow the kernel ones through the include path, so the callers\nmust name the kernel header and not the compat directory.\n\nInclude <linux/module.h> in obd_class.h.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 6b69ee9ba7fc (\"LU-18687 build: handle CONFIG_LUSTRE_FS_SERVER tristate\")\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Idcad82f93def37b3923d64ac4a1f23806a6a6964\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
